  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Forest Programme Facility (the Facility) is a funding    and information initiative supporting the implementation of national  forest programmes (nfps). The Facility operates under a Multi-Donor   Trust Fund and is hosted by the FAO. The Facility has been supported  by Sida since its start in 2002.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The National Forest Programme Facility (the Facility) &#xe4;r ett          finansierings- och informationsinitiativ f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja               implementeringen av nationella skogsprogram ( national forest         programmes, nfps). Facilityn &#xe4;r verksam under en multigivarfond och   FAO &#xe4;r v&#xe4;rdorganisation f&#xf6;r dess sekretariat. Facilityn har f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d av Sida sedan dess start 2002.</narrative>
  </description>
